    "title": "&#x1F4D6; ש״ס תחנה חדשה | Shas Teḥinah Ḥadashah (A New Tkhine of Six Orders), compiled by Ben-Tsiyon Alfes (Vilna 1910)",
    "author": "Ben-Tsiyon Alfes",
